{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id224702287"}, "name":{"label":"LaceyClare"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-16T11:51:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.10"}, "id":{"label":"11617859569"}, "title":{"label":"Effective in reducing phone usage"}, "content":{"label":"This app is really helping me to be mindful of my phone usage and help me to develop healthier alternatives and habits. I was not going to pay for the premium because i assumed that the developer was selling user data and who wants to pay for an app when its making money off the statistics collected from your daily habits, but I read that the developer is not in the data selling business and I appreciate that and hope that’s its true so I did purchase it for the year. I will continue to use onesec but one gripe is that some apps, like gmail open quickly and onesec is not activated fast enough, so I already get a good look at my email for a few seconds before onesec pops up but otherwise it is pretty effective. I only have FB for social media and onesec has been working excellent for keeping usage down.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1338962525"}, "name":{"label":"Cinnacoffee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-14T07:35:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.10"}, "id":{"label":"11609158275"}, "title":{"label":"Genuinely amazing."}, "content":{"label":"I didn’t realize how often I use social media when waiting for something, dealing with difficult emotions or just boredom. It’s so simple but helps so much to have something that helps you take a moment to reflect and asks you if you actually WANT to do what you’re about to do. \n\nPlus the subscription is ACTUALLY just a bonus. You don’t need it to reap the benefits. Please never change that, devlopers 🙏🏼\n\nGreat app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id572996369"}, "name":{"label":"spencer98!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-05T14:27:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.10"}, "id":{"label":"11576445215"}, "title":{"label":"great.., to an extent"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using it and loving it for about 6 months to keep me from mindlessly scrolling on instagram, and it’s been great. but the past few months I started getting these notifications from instagram that they could somehow “detect that my account is automated” and threats to remove my account. I deleted the app a few weeks ago and haven’t gotten a warning since. I don’t know if there is a way to fix this problem but if you guys ever do, i’d love to start using it again.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
