{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id479512990"}, "name":{"label":"Abaggaggagag,,b"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-31T01:38:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.10"}, "id":{"label":"11554970648"}, "title":{"label":"Saved my sanity"}, "content":{"label":"I don’t usually write reviews but this app literally saved my life. I never go on any short form content apps anymore unless completely needed, I now have time to do stuff I really enjoy.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id422869999"}, "name":{"label":"Anna_p928"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-25T10:53:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.10"}, "id":{"label":"11534163883"}, "title":{"label":"Love this app!"}, "content":{"label":"This is helping me a lot with being more mindful of my social media usage. I find it a lot more effective than the time limit control.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id15382180"}, "name":{"label":"Ambro33"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-23T04:22:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.10"}, "id":{"label":"11525279519"}, "title":{"label":"Just try it!"}, "content":{"label":"I was skeptical but, the app was free so I gave it a shot. After an adjustment period where I kept being SUPER annoyed & changing settings constantly, it high key started to work. In fact it worked so well I went from wasting at my peak 8 hours of my life on an app I felt trapped on to deleting Instagram after nearly 12 years of almost daily use. I’ve now re-downloaded Instagram with little to no restrictions placed on it & I still don’t want to use it anymore.\n\nYes it took awhile, for me it was about 9 months. I upgraded to premium maybe 4 months in to utilize the “re-interventions” feature, this isn’t a quick fix but, trust me the constant interruptions are training your brain no matter how you respond to them. I even found what many are saying is a “glitch” where the intervention takes 5 seconds to pop-up letting you catch a glimpse of the app you’re trying to open was good because usually, the dumb reel I suffered through the intervention to see wasn’t worth it & I started hating social media for that! \n\nI also appreciate that the updates they post explain bug fixes in plain language & the instructions for how to set up interventions are similar. The app has no forced ads that are bothersome, except for their paywall and it doesn’t limit the usefulness of the app it just kind of limits how many tools you can utilize & is slightly annoying to exit out of which I found to be pretty reasonable. I was even offered a discount when I did finally get premium, which was great. Its refreshing to finally have an app that seems like it’s trying to actually provide a helpful service first & foremost, instead of focusing mostly on being profitable to the detriment of the user. \n\nSo yeah thanks to the whole app team ya’ll are doing a great thing (& your marketing clearly isn’t too shabby either), so far I have regained about 4.8 weeks of my life thanks to you & the power of annoyance.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
