{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id433749203"}, "name":{"label":"Kian585"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-01T15:54:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11446056543"}, "title":{"label":"Life Changing"}, "content":{"label":"One Sec completely restructured how I use addictive apps.  I used to delete and redownload apps all the time in a bid to suffocate my social media usage but I was always missing the positive aspects it brings.  One Sec has allowed me to be mindful of my usage by putting a weight on the task of opening such apps.  As a result of the breathing tasks my breath capacity has also increased significantly which is amazing as a woodwind player.  I recommend One Sec to all my friends and I couldn’t be happier with the app!  Thank you Frederik", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
